; GROMACS residuetypes.dat supplement for LignoForge lignin monomers
; Add these lines to oplsaa.ff/residuetypes.dat (or a custom residuetypes.dat)
; so that pdb2gmx recognises all LignoForge residue names.
;
; Format:  residue_name    type
; type "Other" = standard small-molecule / non-amino-acid residue.
;
; β-O-4 internal chain units
GYU     Other
HPU     Other
SYU     Other
; Isolated free monolignols
GYM     Other
HPM     Other
SYM     Other
; Neutral saturated references
GNM     Other
HNM     Other
SNM     Other
